5},{"category":"Specialty Schools","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Restaurants","historical_business_count":8},{"category":"Food","historical_business_count":3},{"category":"Wine Tasting Room","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Wine Bars","historical_business_count":0}],"history":[{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Beer, Food, Nightlife, Restaurants, Wine & Spirits","shared_category_count":6},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Food, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1}],"text":[{"business_id":"aPs-Pf4_CLWcFQcMnbfcUw","review_id":"ndqosebc13yBfoWxE1UNYA","date":"2019-02-09T21:57:27","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.948767900466919,"text_excerpt":"We went there on Friday night. Great little place. There were a wide variety of wine selections. We treated it like a tasting room and sampled tons of different wines. The system is so new that the guy at the counter had to explain it to every customer, so they need more advertising about how their process works. But being able to select your own wines and pours gives you a lot of freedom. We also had a Brie which was very tasty. Overall, very enjoyable."},{"business_id":"aPs-Pf4_CLWcFQcMnbfcUw","review_id":"c5VIKN3_sNJHZ9o7X8oa5g","date":"2014-07-02T18:10:59","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9425479173660278,"text_excerpt":"A large group of us came here for my gf's birthday on Saturday night. This place is awesome! I love that you pour your own wines and you can just get a 1-ounce taste if you want. I tried what I though was a large variety, but turned out to be less than 20 out of the 120 available. Anyway, we occupied most of the back area for a good 3-4 hours, and we never felt overly crowded. Some of us ordered food plates - fruit & cheese, salami & cheese, and hummus & bruschetta, all served with pita/crackers. All of the food was very good, and not overly expensive. Our tab was way lower than I thought it would be. Everyone had a great time and we all plan on returning whenever we feel like a wine nigh..."},{"business_id":"aPs-Pf4_CLWcFQcMnbfcUw","review_id":"3QWqEtgmQjOwPSCO2hsJ-A","date":"2010-08-09T16:19:36","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9422650933265686,"text_excerpt":"If you love a wine tasting, but hate pretending that you can taste the subtle notes of oak or plum, then this is the place for you. WINO allows anyone to coordinate their own wine tasting. Sample as much or as little of any wine that you like and you can become a WINO in your own right. I went with a couple of friends and friends of friends. We had a wonderful time. For those, who think it's a little too expensive, I say, go during their happy hour. YES. They have a happy hour. Some of their wines go for half price between the hours of 5pm-7pm. I tasted a few $1 and $2 pours that were pretty good. Unfortunately, I didn't get a chance to sample any of the food, but I saw a bunch of people ..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"aPs-Pf4_CLWcFQcMnbfcUw","photo_id":"kkEhhYbL722nnVZ9p5Pu8g","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/kkEhhYbL722nnVZ9p5Pu8g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9226725101470947},{"business_id":"aPs-Pf4_CLWcFQcMnbfcUw","photo_id":"tT3ioUBG4AG4JRjrv9KWMw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/tT3ioUBG4AG4JRjrv9KWMw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9154713153839111},{"business_id":"aPs-Pf4_CLWcFQcMnbfcUw","photo_id":"AHzeDuGxhMvZMDnmgCj5iQ","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/AHzeDuGxhMvZMDnmgCj5iQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8909562826156616},{"business_id":"aPs-Pf4_CLWcFQcMnbfcUw","photo_id":"ez5YGIFqfB_TWsuxu4nSrg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/ez5YGIFqfB_TWsuxu4nSrg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8710693120956421},{"business_id":"aPs-Pf4_CLWcFQcMnbfcUw","photo_id":"K9Ak4VQpJHYBC4kL5ivKVQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/K9Ak4VQpJHYBC4kL5ivKVQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.821366012096405}]},"notebook_case":null}
